
Pheeder Child Safety Standards

Pheeder is an 18+ platform. We are committed to protecting children from sexual abuse and exploitation and do not allow child sexual abuse material (CSAM) or any content that sexually exploits or endangers minors.

Prohibited Content and Conduct

The following are strictly prohibited:

- Child sexual abuse material (CSAM).
- Sexual exploitation, grooming, or solicitation of minors.
- Content that depicts, promotes, or facilitates the sexual abuse or exploitation of children.
- Attempts to use the platform to endanger or exploit minors.

Reporting and Enforcement

Users can report content or accounts that violate these standards through the reporting features available in Blue Strip Valley. We review reports and may remove content, suspend accounts, or permanently ban users who violate this policy.

We will report suspected child sexual abuse and exploitation to the appropriate authorities or child-protection organizations when required by applicable law.

